the essential mystery of the body and the wine.

29
00:03:03,837 --> 00:03:06,341
What's he trying to get across with that?

30
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:17,336
And it just, this is of course my own interpretation, that when he talks about this is my body and this is my blood,

31
00:03:17,957 --> 00:03:27,169
Most people think, he's talking about Jesus, he's talking about the body, he's talking about, you know, in fact, even in the scriptures there, he says that to some people and they're disgusted with him.

32
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:28,692
