289
00:23:41,486 --> 00:23:44,609
Alicia.

290
00:23:44,829 --> 00:23:46,251
She's wearing pyjamas.

291
00:23:47,974 --> 00:23:49,215
Yes, that's all right.

292
00:23:49,256 --> 00:23:52,119
Thank you for giving your birthday greetings.

293
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,301
Oh, very good.

294
00:23:55,424 --> 00:24:00,592
We wanted to show you the birthday cake that we'll be celebrating your birthday with.

295
00:24:00,811 --> 00:24:01,613
Oh, Fante.

296
00:24:02,733 --> 00:24:03,875
So we're just...

297
00:24:04,210 --> 00:24:05,791
Maybe bring it a little bit closer.

298
00:24:08,455 --> 00:24:29,644
You'll be eating your words very soon, Bente.

299
00:24:31,952 --> 00:24:39,542
So the cards that we sent based on some of the memories that we have from visiting.

300
00:24:39,563 --> 00:24:45,510
I just wanted to share one little story that we still find amusing.

301
00:24:45,611 --> 00:24:52,920
And it was the time that we climbed up a mountain.

302
00:24:52,940 --> 00:25:00,390
And for those of you who don't know where it is, it's a mountain of spiritual significance here in West Kerry.

303
00:25:01,248 --> 00:25:06,574
and named after St. Brandon the Navigator, who went to the shores to America.

304
00:25:07,515 --> 00:25:18,906
So a few years ago, we hiked up with Bhante right at the top where there's a beautiful Catholic cross and an inscription and a little cairn of stones.

305
00:25:18,987 --> 00:25:29,077
So Bhante decided that at the top of the mountain on a clear blue sky day, very calm, that he would chant.

306
00:25:29,934 --> 00:25:52,756
So he sat in the little cairn and he began his chant, his Pally chant, which we joined in, and then suddenly this wind whipped up, started blowing around us at the top of the mountain, and Bhante put up his hands and he said, the wrath of St. Brendan is upon you.

307
00:25:52,776 --> 00:25:56,479
So that's one of the memories we have from one of your visits here to us, Bhante.

308
00:25:57,539 --> 00:25:59,942
Thank you.

309
00:26:00,277 --> 00:26:22,690
anything else anything uh bandy uh john here just to uh wish you a happy birthday thank you that's your first 10-day retreat uh you uh performed in in the pub view hostel for 20 years ago so uh you've gone from strength to strength and uh we thank you for your inspiration

310
00:26:24,289 --> 00:26:25,172
Thank you very much.

311
00:26:25,732 --> 00:26:26,434
Thank you very much.

312
00:26:26,996 --> 00:26:27,576
Keep the cake.

