361
00:29:47,309 --> 00:29:51,415
I've got two things going on at once.

362
00:29:51,435 --> 00:29:53,137
There seems to be a delay on the...

363
00:29:54,063 --> 00:29:55,464
Can you hear me?

364
00:29:55,585 --> 00:29:56,705
Yes, yes.

365
00:29:58,107 --> 00:30:00,671
Ah, well, happy birthday.

366
00:30:00,691 --> 00:30:01,152
Thank you.

367
00:30:01,893 --> 00:30:13,186
And thank you so much for all the teachings you gave me over the years that we've been building together.

368
00:30:13,548 --> 00:30:23,039
There was one incident that actually typifies you, which you probably actually forgot, but we were away in Suffolk

369
00:30:23,678 --> 00:30:25,000
and we went to a church.

370
00:30:26,162 --> 00:30:30,308
And whilst we were wandering around, the Virgin came out and gave us a guided tour.

371
00:30:31,369 --> 00:30:48,538
And there was a chap came into the church who was distressed, didn't have any money to get home, was obviously in an incredibly bad way.

372
00:30:49,362 --> 00:30:56,308
Before the verger could actually say anything, you'd put your hand in your pocket and gave the guy five quid.

373
00:30:56,328 --> 00:31:03,435
And the verger was so blown away, he couldn't believe your generosity and your instant kindness.

374
00:31:04,636 --> 00:31:08,280
And that's a memory that sticks with me when I think of most of the stuff.

375
00:31:09,561 --> 00:31:10,542
Thank you very much, mate.

376
00:31:10,682 --> 00:31:14,307
It was a very...

377
00:31:16,430 --> 00:31:22,457
generous moment, and it just typified your embodying loving-kindness.

378
00:31:22,717 --> 00:31:25,961
Really a nice moment.

379
00:31:25,980 --> 00:31:27,363
Yeah, that was a good moment I had.

380
00:31:33,210 --> 00:31:34,391
Well, we all love them sometimes.

381
00:31:35,092 --> 00:31:36,453
Exactly that.

382
00:31:40,057 --> 00:31:40,498
Take care.

383
00:31:40,979 --> 00:31:44,563
Well, I hope there's another 70 years worth of

384
00:31:45,386 --> 00:31:50,474
That is influence, if not presence, in the South Canyon.

385
00:31:50,734 --> 00:31:52,798
Certainly the building will last another 70 years.

386
00:31:52,838 --> 00:31:53,019
Yes.

