00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:37,904
I've known you for a really long time.

394
00:32:38,678 --> 00:32:40,200
40 years, probably.

395
00:32:40,279 --> 00:32:40,480
Yes.

396
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:46,028
And you always were really, really, really funny and I think you're still really funny.

397
00:32:46,630 --> 00:32:50,454
